smiles2class
============

smiles2class is a code-only implementation of a SMILES-to-molecular-class
classifier.

Authors
-------
David Niteas <david.ql.d@foxmail.com>

What's shipped
--------------
This repository contains code, configuration and documentation only. It does not
include HMDB or LIPID MAPS raw/derived data, trained model directories or model
weights. The 426 class names are derived from the HMDB `Alternative Parents`
field (ClassyFire terms); the data itself is not redistributed.

The molecular encoder is provided by UniMol-Lite (`unimol-lite`), a lightweight
modified implementation of Uni-Mol. It is not the official Uni-Mol release.

